Package: erhai-display-power
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, systemd, libc6 (>= 2.34), gnome-settings-daemon (>= 50), gnome-settings-daemon (<< 51)
Description: Backlight-only display blanking for the OnePlus Pad 2 Pro
 Keeps the display link running while controlling both physical backlights.
 A device-scoped adapter redirects GNOME Settings Daemon 50's display-power
 setter; battery management and GNOME authentication remain in the original
 distribution processes. This workaround increases screen-off power and does
 not establish display recovery from system suspend.
